  "adaptations": [
    "Deckivo local wrapper, app-native USB/Gamepad bridge",
    "Unknown controllers show three separate genuine photos instead of a hybrid",
    "An Xbox family name is not presented as a confirmed Xbox Series model",
    "Firmware download remains via official PS5/PlayStation Accessories; app does not flash firmware",
    "Source body photographs remain byte-identical; equal displayed body height and SVG/Painter contour clip remove the DS4 cast shadow",
    "Artificial photo-floor ellipse removed for all selected controller models",
    "English visible phrases, Android-only USB/Gamepad adapter, app-lifecycle cleanup",
    "Firmware catalog/archive route is fixed to the public RemTeh endpoint; installation stays in official tools"
  ],
